==Grab Data Team==

Grab's [https://github.com/GRABOSM/Grab-Data/blob/master/Grab_Data_Team.md data team] contributes to OpenStreetMap's coverage of a number of Asian cities.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://github.com/GRABOSM/Grab-Data/blob/master/Grab_Data_Team.md |title=Grab Data Team on GitHub |website=GitHub |access-date=30 June 2026}}</ref> For any questions, please get in touch with [[osm:user/Saikat Maiti|Saikat Maiti]] or reach out to us on: geo.community@grab.com

The active OSM user IDs below are grouped by country and linked to their OpenStreetMap profiles.

